  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/S0/R1#data_parallelism">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://example.org/S0/R1#entity"/>
    <rdfs:label rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Data Parallelism</rdfs:label>
    <skos:skos_definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A parallelization technique involving duplicating the model across devices and splitting the dataset among them to process data concurrently.</skos:skos_definition>
    <hasCQ rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0005</hasCQ>
    <hasCQ rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0008</hasCQ>
    <hasCQ rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0054</hasCQ>
    <hasCQ rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0101</hasCQ>
    <hasCQ rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0145</hasCQ>
    <hasCQ rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0190</hasCQ>
    <hasCQ rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0226</hasCQ>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0005</prov:wasDerivedFrom>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0008</prov:wasDerivedFrom>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0054</prov:wasDerivedFrom>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0101</prov:wasDerivedFrom>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0145</prov:wasDerivedFrom>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0190</prov:wasDerivedFrom>
    <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CQ_S0_R1_0226</prov:wasDerivedFrom>
    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2502.21231_rag::chunk_008</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2409.13221_rag::chunk_005</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2405.07719_rag::chunk_007</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2504.15930_rag::chunk_005</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2508.07970_rag::chunk_001</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceChunk rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2405.07719_rag::chunk_006</hasEvidenceChunk>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In data parallelism, all DP ranks must execute the same number of micro-batches, and then synchronize gradients before the model update.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Data Parallelism (DP) replicates the model weights and distributes the data among the replicas to execute in parallel.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The ideal performance is only to reach the performance of DP without communication for attention.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Data Parallelism (DP) involves duplicating the model across devices and splitting the dataset among them, allowing each replica to process different portions of data concurrently.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">partitioning both the model and the data across multiple GPUs or nodes</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">existing hybrid parallelism framework of Data Parallelism (DP), Tensor Parallelism (TP), and Pipeline Parallelism (PP)</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
  <rdf:Description rdf:about="http://example.org/S0/R1#pipeline_parallelism">
    <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class"/>
    <rdfs:subClassOf rdf:resource="http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing"/>
