    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">decomposes the conventional microbatch-level computing units into finer slice-level , where each slice represents a sliced segment of a microbatch.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">4 micro batches (numbered) execute 8 layers over 4 pipeline stages.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
