    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Data format transformation from UTF-8 to binary, like Parquet [ 74 ] or TFRecord [ 22 ], is not free, no matter in CPU</hasEvidenceText>
