    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">PagedAttention ( Kwon et al. , 2023 ), which focus on optimizing the computation process and KV cache management, respectively.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">current systems adopt PagedAttention [ 22 ] to reduce GPU memory fragmentation.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
