    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">For a fixed model size (1B parameters), data scaling is modeled as: L ( D ) = B D + E, where L is validation loss, D is training data budget</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
