    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">To achieve unbiased gradient estimation ( Z = Z ), each gradient chain z p requires compensation by factor ( k/t ) p .</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
