    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">CPU Offloading [ 11 , 50 , 62 ] relieves the GPU memory burden by transferring activations from GPU memory to CPU and loading back to the GPU memory on demand.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
