    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Worker to compute and enqueue a new batch B 6 , and push every other batch back.</hasEvidenceText>
    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">In contrast to remote workers, local workers execute as part of the clients main TensorFlow process</hasEvidenceText>
