    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">the initial disaggregated architecture reshines. First, resource quantities for the generation and training stages need not be identical, allowing more flexible and efficient resource allocation.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
