    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The inference engine design enables our model to function as a hybrid reasoner with both parallel and sequential reasoning capabilities at inference time.</hasEvidenceText>
  </rdf:Description>
