    <hasEvidenceText rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">query the per-problem suffix tree directly. Figure 6 shows that using a pre-request tree may lead to a higher acceptance rate but incurs more speculative time.</hasEvidenceText>
